        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/837136?u=73b5c34325606e447be7074fd0deefc55a004c82&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">My logs are filled with tens of thousands of entries like:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"[29-Jul-2026 12:54:17 UTC] Warning at shkspr.mobi/blog/2025/05/decorative-text-within-html/?utm_source=tldrwebdev: \n[2] scandir(/home/shkspr.mobi/blog/wp-content/uploads/webmention/avatars/news.ycombinator.com/): \nFailed to open directory: \nNo such file or directory in /home/shkspr.mobi/blog/wp-content/plugins/webmention/includes/class-avatar-store.php on line 45\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">[29-Jul-2026 12:54:17 UTC] Warning at shkspr.mobi/blog/2025/05/decorative-text-within-html/?utm_source=tldrwebdev: \n[2] scandir(/home/shkspr.mobi/blog/wp-content/uploads/webmention/avatars/news.ycombinator.com/): \nFailed to open directory: \nNo such file or directory in /home/shkspr.mobi/blog/wp-content/plugins/webmention/includes/class-avatar-store.php on line 45\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This seems to be caused by:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/pfefferle/wordpress-webmention/blob/770edba572bb3fc9e9897a74e131e9e5e8726f46/includes/class-avatar-store.php#L42-L48\">wordpress-webmention/includes/class-avatar-store.php</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n        Lines 42 to 48\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/pfefferle/wordpress-webmention/commit/770edba572bb3fc9e9897a74e131e9e5e8726f46\">770edba</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L42\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"42\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC42\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-k\">public</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">static</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">find_avatar</span>( <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>host</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>author</span> ) { </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L43\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"43\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC43\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> \t<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>upload_dir</span> = <span class=\"pl-en\">trailingslashit</span>( <span class=\"pl-smi\">self</span>::<span class=\"pl-en\">upload_directory</span>( <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>host</span> ) ); </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L44\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"44\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC44\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> \t<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>upload_url</span> = <span class=\"pl-en\">trailingslashit</span>( <span class=\"pl-smi\">self</span>::<span class=\"pl-en\">upload_directory</span>( <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>host</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span> ) ); </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L45\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"45\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC45\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> \t<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>results</span>    = <span class=\"pl-en\">scandir</span>( <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>upload_dir</span> ); </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L46\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"46\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC46\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> \t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> ( ! <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>results</span> ) { </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L47\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"47\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC47\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> \t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>results</span>; </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L48\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"48\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC48\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> \t} </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I do have a directory of <code class=\"notranslate\">wp-content/uploads/webmention/avatars/</code> and it contains lots of entries - but evidentially not all the ones this function is expecting.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Could this be guarded against with <a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.is-dir.php\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">is_dir()</code></a>?</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-html-php notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"if ( is_dir( $upload_dir ) ) {\n   $results    = scandir( $upload_dir );\n} else {\n   return false;\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> ( <span class=\"pl-en\">is_dir</span>( <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>upload_dir</span> ) ) {\n   <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>results</span>    = <span class=\"pl-en\">scandir</span>( <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">$</span>upload_dir</span> );\n} <span class=\"pl-k\">else</span> {\n   <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>;\n}</pre></div>",
